      "Ben Asks Lili Out",
      "",
      "Ben: Lili, what plans do you have for the weekend?",
      "",
      "Lili: Why? What’s up?",
      "",
      "Ben: If you have time, then … I want to invite you out to eat dinner, watch a movie, go shopping, and drink bubble tea.",
      "",
      "Lili: You’re treating me?",
      "",
      "Ben: Yeah! Thank you for inviting me to come to your home to celebrate the Spring Festival.",
